('g2-english-adv-5b2a34181d1b', 2, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-in-context', 'mcq', 5, 'weather', 'The opposite of "hot" is ___.', null, '["warm","cold","cool","sunny"]', '{"text":"cold","index":1}', 'Trái nghĩa của nóng (hot) là lạnh (cold). Warm là ấm, cool là mát - gần nghĩa chứ không trái nghĩa.', 'Tìm từ trái nghĩa cặp nhiệt độ.', '{"grade":2,"coreTopic":"weather","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'b9f5c57a6c813be0', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
