('g4-english-adv-2a2b917c98af', 4, 'english', 'grammar', 'grammar-use-of-english', 'mcq', 4, 'questions', '___ did you go last Sunday? - I went to my grandma''s house.', null, '["What","Where","When","Who"]', '{"text":"Where","index":1}', 'Đáp án là ĐỊA ĐIỂM (nhà bà) → hỏi Where. Các từ khác không phù hợp: ''What'' hỏi vật/việc, ''When'' hỏi giờ.', 'Chọn từ hỏi theo thông tin trả lời.', '{"grade":4,"coreTopic":"questions","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'ad3d5f9376d555af', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
