('g2-math-adv-ed30634237db', 2, 'math', 'problem-solving', 'problem-solving', 'mcq', 4, 'word-problems', 'A book costs 35,000 dong. Binh pays 50,000 dong. How much change does he get back?', null, '["15,000","20,000","25,000","85,000"]', '{"text":"15,000","index":0}', '50,000 - 35,000 = 15,000 đồng tiền thối. Nhiễu 85,000 là phép cộng - đề hỏi tiền thừa.', 'Giải bài toán tiền tệ có lời văn.', '{"grade":2,"coreTopic":"word-problems","moetSubject":"Mathematics","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'c39b68d2a461399a', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
