('g2-science-adv-ef8f0feef2d6', 2, 'science', 'materials', 'science-reasoning', 'mcq', 4, 'materials', 'Which material is best for a window?', null, '["wood","paper","glass","cloth"]', '{"text":"glass","index":2}', 'Cửa sổ cần TRONG SUỐT để lấy sáng - chỉ có kính (glass) trong. Gỗ, giấy, vải không xuyên ánh sáng.', 'Chọn vật liệu theo tính chất trong suốt.', '{"grade":2,"coreTopic":"materials","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '67c7d3da20652d47', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g2-science-adv-8b53e5034515', 2, 'science', 'living-things', 'scientific-observation', 'mcq', 4, 'senses', 'Honey is sweet. Lemons are sour. We know this using our sense of ___.', null, '["sight","hearing","taste","smell"]', '{"text":"taste","index":2}', 'Vị ngọt và chua nhận biết bằng vị giác (taste). Khứu giác ngửi mùi, không phân biệt được vị.', 'Ghép hiện tượng với giác quan đúng.', '{"grade":2,"coreTopic":"senses","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '0144e1e57c3d99b1', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g2-science-adv-9c4a9336f679', 2, 'science', 'earth', 'science-concept', 'mcq', 4, 'water', 'Rain falls down to Earth from ___.', null, '["the sea only","clouds","the moon","rivers"]', '{"text":"clouds","index":1}', 'Mưa rơi từ mây (clouds) khi hơi nước ngưng tụ đủ nặng. Biển là nơi nước bốc hơi, không phải nơi mưa rơi xuống trực tiếp.', 'Hiểu vòng tuần hoàn nước đơn giản.', '{"grade":2,"coreTopic":"water","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'b03b373180663aaa', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g2-science-adv-618ea6b58d6d', 2, 'science', 'living-things', 'science-reasoning', 'mcq', 4, 'animals', 'Fish breathe with gills. Whales live in the sea but breathe with lungs. What must a whale do?', null, '["Stay underwater forever","Come up to the surface to breathe air","Grow gills like a fish","Stop breathing"]', '{"text":"Come up to the surface to breathe air","index":1}', 'Cá voi thở bằng PHỔI (lungs) nên phải nổi lên mặt nước hít không khí - dù sống dưới nước.', 'Suy luận hành vi từ đặc điểm sinh học.', '{"grade":2,"coreTopic":"animals","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '2a2d365c12306ba8', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g2-science-adv-3e9855c69e55', 2, 'science', 'living-things', 'science-concept', 'mcq', 4, 'plants', 'Seeds need water and warmth to start growing. This is called ___.', null, '["germination","photosynthesis","hibernation","melting"]', '{"text":"germination","index":0}', 'Hạt nảy mầm = germination. Photosynthesis là quang hợp, hibernation là ngủ đông - từ vựng nâng cao cần phân biệt.', 'Dùng thuật ngữ nảy mầm đúng.', '{"grade":2,"coreTopic":"plants","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '8050c8de6317d648', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g2-science-adv-25dfe965477a', 2, 'science', 'earth', 'science-reasoning', 'mcq', 5, 'weather', 'The weather report says a storm is coming tomorrow. What should people do?', null, '["Go swimming at the beach","Fly kites in the park","Stay inside and close the windows","Have a picnic outside"]', '{"text":"Stay inside and close the windows","index":2}', 'Bão đến cần ở trong nhà, đóng cửa sổ cho an toàn. Các hoạt động ngoài trời đều nguy hiểm khi có bão.', 'Ra quyết định an toàn theo dự báo thời tiết.', '{"grade":2,"coreTopic":"weather","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '6279a60daab3d364', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g2-science-adv-3874bf538199', 2, 'science', 'living-things', 'scientific-observation', 'mcq', 5, 'groups', 'Which one does NOT belong to the group?', null, '["a bee","an ant","a spider","a butterfly"]', '{"text":"a spider","index":2}', 'Ong, kiến, bướm đều là CÔN TRÙNG (6 chân). Nhện có 8 chân - không phải côn trùng.', 'Phân loại côn trùng và động vật khác.', '{"grade":2,"coreTopic":"groups","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'b67f402d33f4d143', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g3-science-adv-6bd517cc13bf', 3, 'science', 'living-things', 'science-concept', 'mcq', 4, 'skeleton', 'What does our skeleton do?', null, '["It helps us breathe","It holds our body up and protects organs","It makes our blood","It digests our food"]', '{"text":"It holds our body up and protects organs","index":1}', 'Bộ xương đỡ cơ thể đứng vững và bảo vệ nội tạng (ví dụ xương sườn bảo vệ tim, phổi).', 'Biết chức năng của bộ xương.', '{"grade":3,"coreTopic":"skeleton","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'f34a99f2cd106349', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g3-science-adv-ef8bd3bb1eb7', 3, 'science', 'living-things', 'science-reasoning', 'mcq', 4, 'nutrition', 'Which food group gives us the most ENERGY for running and playing?', null, '["sweets and cakes","rice, bread and potatoes","candy and chocolate","butter and oil"]', '{"text":"rice, bread and potatoes","index":1}', 'Tinh bột (rice, bread, potatoes) là nguồn năng lượng chính. Kẹo bánh cũng cho năng lượng nhưng không tốt cho sức khỏe.', 'Phân biệt nhóm thực phẩm theo dinh dưỡng.', '{"grade":3,"coreTopic":"nutrition","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '4ce54e0af4e7ba76', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g3-science-adv-76fa32cb1a40', 3, 'science', 'earth', 'science-concept', 'mcq', 4, 'rocks', 'Fossils are found inside rocks. What is a fossil?', null, '["A living animal","The remains of a plant or animal from long ago","A type of metal","A kind of soil"]', '{"text":"The remains of a plant or animal from long ago","index":1}', 'Hóa thạch là phần còn lại/dấu vết của sinh vật sống từ rất lâu về trước, được giữ trong đá.', 'Định nghĩa hóa thạch.', '{"grade":3,"coreTopic":"rocks","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'b439a03c0e8eb202', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g3-science-adv-443c4b87c3a2', 3, 'science', 'forces', 'science-reasoning', 'mcq', 4, 'forces', 'You push a toy car and it rolls away. What made the car move?', null, '["gravity only","a push force","a magnet","light"]', '{"text":"a push force","index":1}', 'Xe chuyển động do LỰC ĐẨY (push) của tay. Trọng lực giữ xe trên mặt đất chứ không làm xe lăn đi.', 'Nhận biết lực đẩy - kéo gây chuyển động.', '{"grade":3,"coreTopic":"forces","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '770f7e513af50347', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g3-science-adv-615dc78d5c19', 3, 'science', 'forces', 'science-concept', 'mcq', 4, 'magnets', 'Which object will a magnet pull?', null, '["a plastic ruler","a wooden pencil","an iron nail","a rubber eraser"]', '{"text":"an iron nail","index":2}', 'Nam châm chỉ hút kim loại sắt (iron). Nhựa, gỗ, cao su đều không bị hút.', 'Biết vật liệu bị nam châm hút.', '{"grade":3,"coreTopic":"magnets","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '9be57c549de0ff9a', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g3-science-adv-7d74fef5799e', 3, 'science', 'light', 'science-concept', 'mcq', 4, 'light', 'A shadow is made when ___.', null, '["light goes through an object","an object blocks the light","the light is turned off","the object is white"]', '{"text":"an object blocks the light","index":1}', 'Bóng xuất hiện khi vật CHẮN ánh sáng. Vật trong suốt cho sáng xuyên qua thì không tạo bóng rõ.', 'Giải thích sự hình thành bóng.', '{"grade":3,"coreTopic":"light","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'de976784f2d6e0b6', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g3-science-adv-c9457b999723', 3, 'science', 'living-things', 'science-reasoning', 'mcq', 4, 'plants', 'Two same plants are planted. One is put in sunlight, one in a dark cupboard. After one week, the plant in the dark is ___.', null, '["taller and healthier","the same as the other","weak and pale","full of flowers"]', '{"text":"weak and pale","index":2}', 'Cây thiếu sáng không quang hợp được nên yếu, nhợt nhạt (pale). Đây là thí nghiệm kinh điển về ánh sáng.', 'Dự đoán kết quả thí nghiệm cây thiếu ánh sáng.', '{"grade":3,"coreTopic":"plants","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'bd88e84940fedcba', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g3-science-adv-2e11703e0885', 3, 'science', 'earth', 'science-concept', 'mcq', 4, 'soil', 'Why is soil important for plants?', null, '["It makes the garden look nice","It holds water and nutrients for the roots","It keeps the air clean","It stops the wind"]', '{"text":"It holds water and nutrients for the roots","index":1}', 'Đất giữ nước và chất dinh dưỡng (nutrients) để rễ hút nuôi cây.', 'Hiểu vai trò của đất với thực vật.', '{"grade":3,"coreTopic":"soil","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '72e05594b3242b4a', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g3-science-adv-e7e71f15782f', 3, 'science', 'living-things', 'science-reasoning', 'mcq', 4, 'animals', 'A snake has no legs but it is NOT a worm because a snake ___.', null, '["has bones inside its body","is green","is long","can move fast"]', '{"text":"has bones inside its body","index":0}', 'Rắn có xương sống (động vật có xương) - giun không có xương. Màu sắc và hình dáng không phân loại được.', 'Phân loại động vật có xương - không xương.', '{"grade":3,"coreTopic":"animals","moetSubject":"Science","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '4fd65d41f41ca3ad', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
